How to Run the Application

1.⁠ ⁠Install the required packages:
    python -m pip install streamlit numpy pandas scikit-learn joblib
2.⁠ ⁠Open the project folder in the terminal.
3.⁠ ⁠Run:
    streamlit run app.py
4.⁠ ⁠Open the local address shown in the terminal.
5.⁠ ⁠Enter housing details and click Predict House Price.

Conclusion

This project demonstrates how regression algorithms can be used to estimate median house values. The three models were compared using standard regression evaluation metrics, and the trained Random Forest model was integrated into a Streamlit application.